  "instructions": [
    "preheat binchotan grill to medium-high heat",
    "in a small bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, brown sugar, black pepper, coriander seeds, smoked paprika, and salt",
    "add the herring pieces to the marinade and coat well",
    "let the herring marinate for at least 15 minutes, or up to 30 minutes in the refrigerator",
    "remove the herring from the marinade and place on the preheated binchotan grill",
    "grill the herring for 2-3 minutes per side, or until cooked through",
    "serve the herring hot, garnished with lemon wedges if desired"
  ],
